# Day 26 Notes — Account Ledger Integrity Audit

## Goal

Day 26 implemented an internal, read-only audit API that verifies whether an account’s balance and complete balance-operation ledger remain financially consistent.

The audit detects problems but never automatically modifies financial records.

## Endpoint

```http
GET /internal/api/v1/accounts/{accountId}/ledger-integrity
```

Example:

```http
GET /internal/api/v1/accounts/21/ledger-integrity
```

