## Interview explanation

> I implemented a read-only ledger-integrity audit for the Account Service. It reads balance operations chronologically in batches, validates each debit and credit calculation, checks continuity between adjacent operations, and verifies that the latest ledger balance matches the account’s stored balance. It reports detailed discrepancies without automatically modifying financial data, because corrections must occur through approved and auditable adjustments or reversals.

## Day 26 outcome

The platform can now prove whether an account’s stored balance is supported by a mathematically valid and continuous transaction ledger.